{"parentUuid":"e74f36d0-511e-4fe6-899d-b9998015049e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b712eadb-fc3b-498e-ba2d-43adcc2977d0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HMxUgVor8EtKsrhG6e2Yav","type":"tool_result","content":"it through a workflow, and a reviewed change comes out. A workflow is a graph\nof steps that you see on a canvas. Each step is a prompt, an agent, a skill, a\ncommand or a shell script, each with one text you edit, and each waits for\nyour approval or runs on its own, as you set it. Bastion ships the common\nworkflows with their text filled in, and every word of them is yours to\n  setup, its VM image, and what happens to a job's branch at the end.\n- **Workflows:** series of steps. A step is a prompt, one of the\n  repository's agents, skills or commands, or a shell script. Each step has\n  one text to edit, a dial (a sun when a person decides, a moon when it runs\n  on its own), and the results it passes on.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"85e1ad5b-1f1e-4088-a7bf-7408898c8f5b","timestamp":"2026-11-11T23:20:22.576Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"it through a workflow, and a reviewed change comes out. A workflow is a graph\nof steps that you see on a canvas. Each step is a prompt, an agent, a skill, a\ncommand or a shell script, each with one text you edit, and each waits for\nyour approval or runs on its own, as you set it. Bastion ships the common\nworkflows with their text filled in, and every word of them is yours to\n  setup, its VM image, and what happens to a job's branch at the end.\n- **Workflows:** series of steps. A step is a prompt, one of the\n  repository's agents, skills or commands, or a shell script. Each step has\n  one text to edit, a dial (a sun when a person decides, a moon when it runs\n  on its own), and the results it passes on.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"fff159a7-c011-4d16-a6bc-8431115f688d","context":{"git_state":