{"parentUuid":"74f41b99-0fad-42f3-98fe-7c0844f1c1a1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwzqNeGxfobHgtpEt1Rt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015YQmKPnhZgLm6UoWVG85iH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        assert s.count(a)==1,(p,a[:70]); s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\nedit('README.md',[('''of steps that you see on a canvas. Each step is a prompt, an agent, a skill, a\ncommand or a shell script, each with one text you edit, and each waits for''','''of steps that you see on a canvas. Each step is a prompt, an agent, a skill\nor a shell script, each with one text you edit, and each waits for''')])\nedit('VISION.md',[('''- **Workflows:** series of steps. A step is a prompt, one of the\n  repository's agents, skills or commands, or a shell script. Each step has''','''- **Workflows:** series of steps. A step is a prompt, one of the\n  repository's agents or skills, or a shell script. Each step has''')])\ns=open('DECISIONS.md').read()\nlines=s.split('\\n')\ni=[k for k,l in enumerate(lines) if l.startswith('| D44 |')][0]\nlines.insert(i+1,\"| D45 | A step is a prompt, an agent, a skill or a shell script. A repository's command is not a kind of its own: a prompt that reads its file does what it did, and that is what migration 7 makes of each command step. This narrows D39. |\")\nopen('DECISIONS.md','w').write('\\n'.join(lines))\nedit('PLAN.md',[('''## After this plan\n''','''### U9. No command steps (D45)\n\n- A step is a prompt, an agent, a skill or a shell script.\n- Migration 7 turns each command step into a prompt that reads its\n  command's file, and the grants for commands go.\n\n## After this plan\n''')])\nEOF\ncargo fmt --all; CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo build -p bastion-desktop -p bastion-server 2>&1 | grep -E \"^error\" -A5; CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo test --workspace 2>&1 | grep -E \"F