{"type":"last-prompt","lastPrompt":"Next up I'd like to add a constraints and capabilities section to the workflows page. Each step can have these, so I want to be able to manage them in that view. Also, don't do deny for capabilities -…","leafUuid":"1fa9cc56-90af-421e-a973-985c291cf656","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e"}
{"type":"ai-title","aiTitle":"Picking up where we left off","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e"}
