{"parentUuid":"3184f649-3516-477d-b057-d1ed65498279","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e723e4bd-fa24-4e01-8cef-c0ff7712a74f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DxxfMw4FV6bmkPkDC5foUH","type":"tool_result","content":"VISION.md:35:agent's calls. The factory bound the work around them: what a step may do,","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6eb60f87-5634-41b9-89c8-4f1afdd8d38a","timestamp":"2026-11-12T00:31:22.741Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"VISION.md:35:agent's calls. The factory bound the work around them: what a step may do,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":12,"newStart":1,"newLines":13,"lines":[" # Bastion"," ","-Bastion is a software factory you can govern. A request goes in, agents work","-it through a workflow, and a reviewed change comes out. A workflow is a graph","-of steps that you see on a canvas. Each step is a prompt, an agent, a skill","-or a shell script, each with one text you edit, and each waits for","-your approval or runs on its own, as you set it. Bastion ships the common","-workflows with their text filled in, and every word of them is yours to","-change. Bastion is a server and its clients: `bastion-server` runs the factory on","+Bastion is an agent control plane. You define workflows and send requests,","+and Bastion fulfills each request as a job that runs agents through the","+workflow's steps. A workflow is a graph of steps that you see on a canvas.","+Each step is a prompt, an agent, a skill or a shell script, each with one","+text you edit, and each step carries its own model, budget and rules. A step","+waits for your approval or runs on its own, as you set it. Bastion ships the","+common workflows with their text filled in, and every word of them is yours","+to change. Bastion is a server and its clients: `bastion-server` runs jobs on"," the [iii](https://iii.dev) engine, and the desktop app (on"," [iced](https://iced.rs)) and the `bastion` command line talk to it over HTTP."," It's early. [VISION.md](VISION.md) says where it is going, and"]},{"oldStart":34,"oldLines":8,"newStart":35,"newLines":8,"lines":[" ```"," "," The client starts a local server if none runs on port 49190, and the server","-starts the stack in `worker-compose.yaml`. Go to **Engine** to see Doctor and","-the stack, then **Jobs** and **New request** to start work.","+starts its engine from `worker-compose.yaml`. Go to **Engine** to see Doctor","+and the engine, then **Jobs** and **New request** to start work."," "," ## What it is not"," "]},{"oldStart":49,"oldLines":9,"newStart":50,"newLines":9,"lines":[" "," - Rust, from `rust-toolchain.toml` (rustup picks it up)."," - `iii` 0.25.0 on your `PATH`.","-- A model provider key, set in **Settings**, which keeps it in the stack's","+- A model provider key, set in **Settings**, which keeps it in the engine's","   vault. A key in the environment works too.","-- A `GH_TOKEN` in the stack's vault for the workflows that open pull","+- A `GH_TOKEN` in the engine's vault for the workflows that open pull","   requests: their shell steps ask for the network and that secret. A workflow","   that merges on this machine works without it."," "]},{"oldStart":62,"oldLines":9,"newStart":63,"newLines":9,"lines":[" "," | Part | Where | Does |"," |---|---|---|","-| Core | `crates/bastion-core` | The factory's rules, as pure functions. |","+| Core | `crates/bastion-core` | The rules a job runs by, as pure functions. |"," | Protocol | `crates/bastion-protocol` | The API's types and routes, shared by the server and its clients. |","-| Server | `crates/bastion-server` | The HTTP API and its events, the factory, the store, the gate, the audit and the stack. |","+| Server | `crates/bastion-server` | The HTTP API and its events, the job runner, the store, the gate, the audit and the engine. |"," | Engine adapter | `crates/bastion-server/src/engine/` | The only server code that imports `iii-sdk`. |"," | Client library | `crates/bastion-client` | What every client uses to reach a server: the server list, the local server's start, the calls and the event stream. |"," | Desktop client | `crates/bastion-desktop` | The pages, on iced. |"]},{"oldStart":86,"oldLines":5,"newStart":87,"newLines":5,"lines":[" cargo test --workspace"," ```"," ","-CI runs the same on macOS and Linux. The live checks need a running stack:","+CI runs the same on macOS and Linux. The live checks need a running engine:"," `cargo test -p bastion-server -- --ignored --nocapture`."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/README.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a27c7735-4430-4d30-812a-a35bb65a3ba7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3184f649-3516-477d-b057-d1ed65498279","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
