{"parentUuid":"c7c9cc2d-0c35-4354-8048-cd16b7be39c2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e723e4bd-fa24-4e01-8cef-c0ff7712a74f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012MSnKg7twTGcHMFDEXar8D","type":"tool_result","content":"   837528a..d12acc0  main -> main\n3:Bastion is a software factory you can govern. A request goes in, agents work\n6:runs the factory on the iii engine, and clients such as the iced desktop app\n45:| D18 | The factory's rules live in `bastion-core`: pure functions from an event and a state to a new state and effects, with no I/O and no `async`. |\n51:| D25 | Every rule belongs to one layer: the charter (the repository's own), the harness (an agent's calls), or the factory (the workflow). |\n63:| D37 | The desktop client is a native Rust app on `iced`. It holds no factory logic and reaches a server only through the client library. |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"79f23c87-b718-4c5e-a950-42b92e66e104","timestamp":"2026-11-12T00:32:54.797Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"   837528a..d12acc0  main -> main\n3:Bastion is a software factory you can govern. A request goes in, agents work\n6:runs the factory on the iii engine, and clients such as the iced desktop app\n45:| D18 | The factory's rules live in `bastion-core`: pure functions from an event and a state to a new state and effects, with no I/O and no `async`. |\n51:| D25 | Every rule belongs to one layer: the charter (the repository's own), the harness (an agent's calls), or the factory (the workflow). |\n63:| D37 | The desktop client is a native Rust app on `iced`. It holds no factory logic and reaches a server only through the client library. |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"gitOperation":{"push":{"branch":"main"}}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"40fb0b56-1b06-45dc-a1f3-6d804947c775","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","s