{"parentUuid":"4fa173f2-8a51-42c2-8fbf-10d0ad434a2b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxAH4HjVFCHZiyFFKzaQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The map is back. My design for C3:\n- **The core holds the step until the review ends.** `done()` doesn't call `wait` while the step has a reviewer. It emits `Effect::Review` instead, and the job stays Running.\n- **The core learns the reviewers from `Bounds`.** The server already computes `Bounds` for each event, so it adds the reviewers at the current step there.\n- **The server runs one turn per reviewer.** It copies `evals::grade`: one turn, no tools, the diff or the reply in the message, and the agent file as the brief. Then it sends `Event::Reviewed`:\n  - pass → `wait()`\n  - fail → `step_failed`\n  - the reviewer could not run → `stuck`\n\nNext I'll read the code those pieces touch."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4598,"cache_read_input_tokens":248263,"output_tokens":2130,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1621},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4598,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2130,"cache_read_input_tokens":248263,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4598,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4598},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"45a7c6e7-84d7-44e5-bc5d-afe22a24b553","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgxAH3z8aAnrZFJPwMWwn","type":"assistant","uuid":"6afe1b1f-40e4-4d62-9263-3b6233538466","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:24:33.488Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort"